{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bend fire, water, earth and air in chaotic online combat and co-op!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elements Divided lets you become a peak elemental warrior, moving your hands to summon attacks and defenses, levelling up your character, and using your powers to hurl yourself across arenas. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the elements, each with their own playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roughly 60 attacks and abilities across four core elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cast fireballs, control the flow of water, summon air shields, build earthly barriers and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand-off in thrilling online modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your skills to the test in PvP or team up with friends to take on scores of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your ranks in each element to earn new skills and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your fighter to your liking with a huge range of personalization options<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805770/extras/GIF_STEAM_Elements.gif?t=1742996938\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2805770?t=1742996938","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805770/c8ca8717b24ee074e01f89a93f8043a58cd2db4a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742996938","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805770/44f4a3634f6703abc9e408b007e3f9d42e3d4966/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742996938","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805770/44f4a3634f6703abc9e408b007e3f9d42e3d4966/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742996938","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},